WEBVTT

00:02:27.101 --> 00:02:30.688
shuning uchun qarshi og’irlik bu
balandlikdan  tashqarida bo’lishi kerak .

00:02:30.688 --> 00:02:35.401
Ushbu aniq masofadagi ob’ektlar
geostatsionar orbitada,

00:02:35.401 --> 00:02:39.655
ya’ni ular Yer atrofida
sayyora aylanish tezligida aylanadi,

00:02:39.822 --> 00:02:42.825
shunday qilib osmonda
harakatsiz ko’rinadi.

00:02:42.825 --> 00:02:45.870
Qarshi og’irlikning o’zi
har qanday narsa bo’lishi mumkin,

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:48.039
hatto qo’lga olingan asteroid ham.

00:02:48.039 --> 00:02:51.751
Bu yerdan rishta
atmosfera orqali tushishi mumkin edi

00:02:51.751 --> 00:02:55.338
va sayyora yuzasidagi
tayanch stansiyaga ulangan .

00:02:55.504 --> 00:02:58.257
Santrifüj tezlashuvini
maksimal darajada oshirish uchun,

00:02:58.299 --> 00:03:01.469
bu langar nuqtasi
Ekvatorga yaqin bo’lishi kerak .